      "battles": { "commands": ["startLiveBattle", "acceptLiveBattleInvitation", "recordBattleScoreFromGift", "endLiveBattle", "settleLiveBattle", "forfeitLiveBattle"], "queries": ["getLiveBattle", "getBattleScoreboard", "listBattleHistory"], "events": ["liveBattleStarted", "battleScoreChanged", "liveBattleEnded", "liveBattleSettled"], "stack": "Go live (battle state machine + settlement through ledger journal entries, optional winner-takes-all) + LiveKit for the split-screen media + Elixir for realtime score events", "why": "Scores come from gifts, so the authoritative score must be derived from the same idempotent gift writes; Go settles once with a balanced journal entry (normal split or winnerTakesAll moving the loser's battle earnings to the winner); Elixir pushes battleScoreChanged at sub-second latency to all viewers of both rooms." }
